              Door, frame, gasketing, threshold, and installation affect performance.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div><!-- /.eto-ac__cards -->

      <!-- ---------- 4. Report details strip ---------- -->
      <div class="eto-ac__panel eto-ac__report">
        <div class="eto-ac__report-cell">
